      "Covers Logit, Probit, multinomial, ordinal, count, and zero-inflated models.",
      "Supports ARIMA, SARIMAX, VAR, state-space, stationarity, and forecast evaluation workflows.",
      "Provides residual, influence, heteroskedasticity, autocorrelation, normality, and specification diagnostics.",
